note Blackwell SM121 Native Hardware NVFP4 Tensor Core (OMMA.SF.16864.F32.E2M1.E2M1.UE4M3.4X)
note Silicon-verified on DGX Spark GB10: 16x8x64 = 16,384 FLOPs/insn, ZERO software unpack!
note =========================================================================
fn qOmmaCtrl rD ulong rA ulong rB ulong rSa ulong rSb ulong isFast ulong to void
w = new ulong 4 0
put w 0 or or 29823 shl and rD 255 16 shl and rA 255 24
v1 = or 1879048192 and rB 255
v1 = or v1 shl and rSa 255 8
v1 = or v1 shl and rSb 255 20
put w 1 v1
put w 2 or 278016 and rD 255
if eq isFast 1
put w 3 qcw 8 7 7 0 0
else
put w 3 qcw 15 7 7 0 0
end
pc = get q36Pc 0
base = mul pc 4
for i ulong 4
put q36Buf add base i get w i
end
put q36Pc 0 add pc 1
end

