end
qLit 10 0
mNvKb = get q36Pc 0
note 1. Single overlapped LDG wave: X_nv4 (2x LDG.128) + Sx (LDG.32) + W_nv4 (LDG.128) + S_nv4 (@!P0 LDG.32)!
qic 57 48 4 QZ 0 qLd
qLit 59 1
qic 28 QZ 19 59 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 11 52 6 QZ 0 qLd
for j ulong 8
