qLit 59 4
qicImm 8 54 45 QZ 1 qAlu4
for j ulong 8
qic 50 QZ 54 add 24 j 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
if lt j 7
qIadd 54 54 59
end
end
qic 50 QZ 46 53 0 qSt
qicImm 8 54 47 QZ 1 qAlu4
for j ulong 4
qic 50 QZ 54 add 48 j 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
if lt j 3
qIadd 54 54 59
end
end
qLit 59 1
qic 28 QZ 19 59 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 50 QZ 58 52 0 qSt
qBar
note 2. Load A (R40..43) + Rsa (R44) directly from SMEM -- ZERO software unpack!
qLit 54 256
qIadd 55 13 54
qLit 54 16
qIadd 56 13 54
qIadd 57 55 54
qic 49 40 13 QZ 0 qLd
qic 49 41 55 QZ 0 qLd
qic 49 42 56 QZ 0 qLd
qic 49 43 57 QZ 0 qLd
qic 49 44 16 QZ 0 qLd
