qLit 59 1
qicImm 9 0 59 0 32 qAlu1
qicImm 9 2 59 2 4 qAlu1
qicImm 9 4 59 4 32 qAlu1
qicImm 9 6 59 6 4 qAlu1
qIadd 10 10 59
qic 28 QZ 10 23 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mNvKb get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
note Epilogue: store R60..R123 -> Y[tok, rA/rB] via R8:9
qParam 23 44
qic 18 19 14 QZ 3 qAlu4
qMad 19 19 2 QZ
qLit 57 8
qIadd 59 15 57
qLit 58 1
for tc ulong 16
q38NvSuperStoreTc tc
end
end

